  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the mains admit card for the post of <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">Assistant Teacher (TGT)</span>. This recruitment was released for 7466 posts. Applications for the UP LT Grade Assistant Teacher Mains Recruitment 2026 were accepted from April 02, 2026, to April 17, 2026. The written examination is going to be conducted on 13 June 2026 and 11 July 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their UP LT Grade Assistant Teacher Mains Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPPSC LT Grade Teacher Mains Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPPSC TGT Advt No : A-5/E-1/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>28 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>28 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>28 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>04 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date&nbsp;:<b> 06 December 2025 to 25 January 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available&nbsp;<b>: 26 November 2025</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key (Biology, English) :&nbsp;<strong>28 January 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result (Hindi, Math) : <strong>05 February 2026</strong>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result (Science, home Science, Sanskrit, Commerce) : <strong>18 February 2026</strong>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result (Urdu, Art, Agri/Horti, Music) : <strong>12 March 2026 Available</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Computer Exam Date : <strong>05 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Computer Admit Card : <strong>26 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Update : <strong>01 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Mains Online Form&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>02 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>17 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam Date (Commerce) : <strong>22 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Download Mains Admit Card (Commerce) : <strong>16 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam Date (Sanskrit) : <strong>23 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Download Mains Admit Card (Sanskrit) : <strong>17 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Sociology, Physical Education, Music, Hindi Mains Exam Date : <strong>11 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Sociology, Physical Education, Music, Hindi Mains Admit Card : <strong>12 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Biology, Urdu Mains Exam Date : <strong>13 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>06 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC : <strong>Rs. 125/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST Candidates : <strong>Rs. 65/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Ex-Service Candidates : <strong>Rs. 65/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH Candidates:<strong>&nbsp;Rs.25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPPSC LT Grade Teacher Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPPSC TGT Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPPSC Assistant Teacher TGT 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 7466 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Teacher TGT Male</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">4860</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Teacher TGT Female</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2525</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Teacher TGT Backlog Posts</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">81</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPPSC LT Grade Teacher Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Graduate Degree with B.Ed in Related Subject from any recognized University in India will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have passed B.Ed.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>Subject Wise Vacancy Details – <a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/View_Enclosure-English-2_page-0001.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a>&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UPPSC LT Grade Assistant Teacher Mains Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download mains admit card link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-s